{"notes":[{"id":"kkwz9OM8ys2VvCkTN00g","body":"Advaita AI Blueprint — Intake Form v6 (12Q)\n---\nBusiness name: Summit Street Tacos\nWebsite: https://summitstreettacos.com\nRevenue: $2M\nTeam size: 25\nTools: CRM: gohighlevel, Team Comms: slack, Docs: google_drive, PM: clickup, Other tools: Email Marketing, Booking/Scheduling, Accounting/Invoicing, Payments Processing, Business Phone/SMS, Social Platforms, Paid Advertising, Social Media Mgmt\nTime drain: lead_followup\nPersonal hrs/wk: 28\nCompany hrs/wk: 180\nMonthly marketing spend: $12.5K/mo\n---\nPerfect world vision:\nWe run three Denver-area fast-casual taco shops. I want online catering inquiries, franchise inquiries, and local guest feedback routed instantly, scored, followed up, and summarized without managers copying notes between Square, Slack, email, and spreadsheets.\n---\nPain points:\nWe miss catering leads after dinner rush, managers spend hours chasing reviews and scheduling team follow-up, and I do not have one clean dashboard for location-level sales, guest issues, and franchise inquiry quality.\n---\nForm version: 2026-05-23-v6\n\n--- Relay payload summary ---\n{\n  \"event_name\": \"blueprint_apply_submit\",\n  \"form_version\": \"2026-05-27-identity-webhook-v1\",\n  \"source\": \"blueprint_ai_apply\",\n  \"original_source\": \"apply\",\n  \"blueprint_slug\": \"\",\n  \"lead_session_id\": \"advaita-mpwshjrg-9hb879ds\",\n  \"qualification_band\": \"\",\n  \"revenue_value\": 2000000,\n  \"submitted_at\": \"2026-06-02T15:25:34.156Z\",\n  \"relay_mode\": \"updated\",\n  \"contact_id\": \"IX7XsHPPPOJ57aWZsOLK\"\n}","bodyText":"Advaita AI Blueprint — Intake Form v6 (12Q)\n---\nBusiness name: Summit Street Tacos\nWebsite: https://summitstreettacos.com\nRevenue: $2M\nTeam size: 25\nTools: CRM: gohighlevel, Team Comms: slack, Docs: google_drive, PM: clickup, Other tools: Email Marketing, Booking/Scheduling, Accounting/Invoicing, Payments Processing, Business Phone/SMS, Social Platforms, Paid Advertising, Social Media Mgmt\nTime drain: lead_followup\nPersonal hrs/wk: 28\nCompany hrs/wk: 180\nMonthly marketing spend: $12.5K/mo\n---\nPerfect world vision:\nWe run three Denver-area fast-casual taco shops. I want online catering inquiries, franchise inquiries, and local guest feedback routed instantly, scored, followed up, and summarized without managers copying notes between Square, Slack, email, and spreadsheets.\n---\nPain points:\nWe miss catering leads after dinner rush, managers spend hours chasing reviews and scheduling team follow-up, and I do not have one clean dashboard for location-level sales, guest issues, and franchise inquiry quality.\n---\nForm version: 2026-05-23-v6\n\n--- Relay payload summary ---\n{\n\"event_name\": \"blueprint_apply_submit\",\n\"form_version\": \"2026-05-27-identity-webhook-v1\",\n\"source\": \"blueprint_ai_apply\",\n\"original_source\": \"apply\",\n\"blueprint_slug\": \"\",\n\"lead_session_id\": \"advaita-mpwshjrg-9hb879ds\",\n\"qualification_band\": \"\",\n\"revenue_value\": 2000000,\n\"submitted_at\": \"2026-06-02T15:25:34.156Z\",\n\"relay_mode\": \"updated\",\n\"contact_id\": \"IX7XsHPPPOJ57aWZsOLK\"\n}","userId":null,"dateAdded":"2026-06-02T15:25:35.952Z","contactId":"IX7XsHPPPOJ57aWZsOLK","pinned":false,"relations":[]},{"id":"V4veGSEjE52POu6QAE5A","body":"Advaita AI Blueprint — Controlled Chad test apply submit. Business: Summit Street Tacos. Denver 3-unit fast-casual taco group. Time drain: lead follow-up, catering/franchise inquiries, guest feedback, manager reporting. Chad/Codex 2026-06-02.\n\n--- Relay payload summary ---\n{\n  \"event_name\": \"blueprint_apply_submit\",\n  \"form_version\": \"2026-05-27-identity-webhook-v1\",\n  \"source\": \"blueprint_ai_apply\",\n  \"original_source\": \"apply\",\n  \"blueprint_slug\": \"\",\n  \"lead_session_id\": \"advaita-codex-chad-summit-20260602\",\n  \"qualification_band\": \"\",\n  \"revenue_value\": 2000000,\n  \"submitted_at\": \"2026-06-02T15:24:15Z\",\n  \"relay_mode\": \"cre